From f18d8252ee77939eaa109af35221424a439a0381 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ShilohYu <84455289+ShilohYu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 09:47:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(runtime): add per-microbatch replica buffer slots

Allocate replica weight, scale, and grad buffers by max_microbatches
and index them with the virtual-layer slot so intra-layer MB>1 can
reuse one Manager without overwriting in-flight replicas.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
